# General Folders

> {{ site.description }}

General Folders is a business-to-business data transfer product. Each transfer
is a durable exchange object: define an exchange, connect the source and
destination endpoints you own, set a cadence, and run it. Credentials are held
as secret references and transfers execute in isolated workers. Every run
records counts, checksums, retries, and failure detail behind a
permission-scoped audit trail. The product is API-first and can be embedded in
another product.

